    "meaning": "already; yet (in questions)",
    "shortDefinition": "Something has happened sooner than expected, or at all."
  },
  "intro": {
    "title": "Schon fertig?",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Schon = already: Ich bin schon da. In questions it's 'yet' or 'ever': Hast du schon gegessen? Warst du schon mal in Berlin? It's often confused with schön (beautiful)."
    ]
  },
  "wordFamily": [
